{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15683","headline":"闲园即事寄暕公 · 司空曙","name":"闲园即事寄暕公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲就东林寄一身，尚怜儿女未成人。\n柴门客去残阳在，药圃虫喧秋雨频。\n近水方同梅市隐，曝衣多笑阮家贫。\n深山兰若何时到，羡与闲云作四邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}